(533, 1, '2019-07-08 11:08:12', '2019-07-08 11:08:12', '[et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" fullwidth=\"on\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" background_color=\"#F86E01\" custom_padding=\"0px||0px\" bottom_divider_style=\"ramp2\" bottom_divider_color=\"#F7F9FB\" bottom_divider_flip=\"horizontal\"][et_pb_fullwidth_header title=\"Visi & Misi\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" title_font=\"||||||||\" title_font_size=\"40px\" background_color=\"#F86E01\" custom_padding=\"32px||29px|||\"][/et_pb_fullwidth_header][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" background_color=\"#F7F9FB\" width=\"100%\" width_tablet=\"100%\" width_phone=\"100%\" width_last_edited=\"off|tablet\" module_alignment=\"center\" custom_padding=\"105px|||||\"][et_pb_row custom_padding=\"0px||0px|||\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" header_font=\"|300||on|||||\" header_text_color=\"#ffffff\" header_font_size=\"24px\" header_letter_spacing=\"2px\" background_color=\"#FF147B\" custom_css_main_element=\"position: absolute;||float: left;||left: 40px;||padding: 10px 40px 0 40px;||border-top-left-radius: 20px;||border-bottom-right-radius: 20px;||margin-top: -54px;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"]<h1>Visi</h1>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row custom_padding=\"50px||\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" background_color=\"#ffffff\" custom_css_main_element=\"margin-top: -28px;||padding: 40px;||border-top-left-radius: 20px;||border-bottom-right-radius: 20px;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"]Lembaga Pendidikan Islam Pencetak Kader Pemimpin Umat yang berakhlaq mulia, berwawasan luas, dan mampu mengembangkan diri untuk tegaknya peradapan Islam.[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" background_color=\"#F7F9FB\" width=\"100%\" width_tablet=\"100%\" width_phone=\"100%\" width_last_edited=\"off|tablet\" module_alignment=\"center\" custom_padding=\"0px||65px|||\"][et_pb_row custom_padding=\"||0px|||\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" header_font=\"|300||on|||||\" header_text_color=\"#ffffff\" header_font_size=\"24px\" header_letter_spacing=\"2px\" background_color=\"#FF147B\" custom_css_main_element=\"position: absolute;||float: left;||left: 40px;||padding: 10px 40px 0 40px;||border-top-left-radius: 20px;||border-bottom-right-radius: 20px;||margin-top: -54px;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"]<h1>Misi</h1>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row custom_padding=\"50px||\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" background_color=\"#ffffff\" custom_css_main_element=\"margin-top: -28px;||padding: 40px;||border-top-left-radius: 20px;||border-bottom-right-radius: 20px;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"]<table class=\"table-list\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Membentuk generasi muslim yang unggul, berdikari, berpengetahuan luas siap menjadi da\'i dan ulama yang intelek.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Membentuk karakter atau pribadi muslim yang bertauhid, beriman dan menjalankan syariah Allah.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Menjadikan kampus pesantren Rooihatul Jannah sebagai lembaga berkualitas yang representatif, eksekutif &amp; kreatif serta menjadi rujukan ummat.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section]', 'Visi & Misi', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '488-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-07-08 11:08:12', '2019-07-08 11:08:12', '', 488, 'https://pondokroja.com/488-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
