if, eksekutif &amp; kreatif serta menjadi rujukan ummat.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" background_color=\"#E30083\" custom_padding=\"||0px|||\" top_divider_height=\"70px\" bottom_divider_height=\"70px\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"bottom\"][et_pb_row custom_padding=\"0px||0px|||\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" text_font=\"||||||||\" text_text_align=\"center\" text_text_color=\"#ffffff\" header_font=\"|300||on|||||\" header_text_align=\"center\" header_text_color=\"#ffffff\" header_letter_spacing=\"4px\"]<h1>Program</h1>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=\"1_2,1_2\" custom_margin=\"||-102px\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_column type=\"1_2\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_css_main_element=\"padding: 50px 40px 60px;||border-radius: 20px;||background: #FFFFFF;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"][et_pb_blurb title=\"Sistem Pendidikan Formal\" use_icon=\"on\" font_icon=\"%%310%%\" use_icon_font_size=\"on\" icon_font_size=\"22px\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" header_font=\"|||on|||||\" header_text_align=\"center\" header_font_size=\"18px\" header_letter_spacing=\"4px\" body_font=\"||||||||\" body_text_align=\"center\" background_color=\"#ffffff\" custom_margin=\"||30px\" custom_css_blurb_image=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"]Yaitu sistem pendidikan klasikal selama lima hari (Senin, Selasa, Rabu, Kamis dan Sabtu) hari Jum’at libur sedangkan hari Ahad acara tasmi’ al-quran. Dalam satu pekan para santri masuk kelas mulai pukul. 07.30 s/d 11.50 WIB diselingi dengan istirahat. 09.30 s/d 09.45, sholat Dhuhur pada...[/et_pb_blurb][et_pb_button button_url=\"https://pondokroja.com/program/#sistem-pendidikan-formal\" button_text=\"Selengkapnya\" button_alignment=\"center\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_button=\"on\" button_text_size=\"16px\" button_text_color=\"#7CDA24\" button_bg_color=\"#ffffff\" button_border_width=\"5px\" button_border_color=\"#ffffff\" button_border_radius=\"5px\" button_letter_spacing=\"2px\" button_font=\"|700||on|||||\" button_use_icon=\"off\" custom_margin=\"||\" custom_css_main_element=\"box-shadow: 0 14px 26px -12px rgba(124, 218, 36, 0.42), 0 4px 23px 0 rgba(124, 218, 36, 0.12), 0 8px 10px -5px rgba(124, 218, 36, 0.2);\" button_letter_spacing__hover_enabled=\"on\" button_letter_spacing__hover=\"4px\"][/et_pb_button][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"1_2\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_css_main_element=\"padding: 50px 40px 60px;||border-radius: 20px;||background: #FFFFFF;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"][et_pb_blurb title=\"Sistem Pendidikan Non Formal\" use_icon=\"on\" font_icon=\"%%310%%\" icon_color=\"#F86E01\" use_icon_font_size=\"on\" icon_font_size=\"22px\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" header_font=\"|||on|||||\" header_text_align=\"center\" header_font_size=\"18px\" header_letter_spacing=\"4px\" body_font=\"||||||||\" body_text_align=\"center\" background_color=\"#ffffff\" custom_margin=\"||30px\" custom_css_blurb_image=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"]<p>Untuk menjaga keseimbangan antara ilmiyah (aspek keilmuan) dan amaliyah (praktek) yang menjadi ciri khas pesantren maka perlu adanya suatu sistem pendidikan non formal. Melalui kegiatan ini ilmu yang didapat di kelas lansung bisa diaplikasikan dalam dunia nyata. Fungsi kegiatan non formal...</p>[/et_pb_blurb][et_pb_button button_url=\"https://pondokroja.com/program/#sistem-pendidikan-nonformal\" button_text=\"Selengkapnya\" button_alignment=\"center\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_button=\"on\" button_text_size=\"16px\" button_text_color=\"#F86E01\" button_bg_color=\"#ffffff\" button_border_width=\"5px\" button_border_color=\"#ffffff\" button_border_radius=\"5px\" button_letter_spacing=\"2px\" button_font=\"|700||on|||||\" button_use_icon=\"off\" custom_margin=\"||\" custom_css_main_element=\"box-shadow: 0 14px 26px -12px rgba(248, 110, 1, 0.42), 0 4px 23px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.12), 0 8px 10px -5px rgba(248, 110, 1, 0.2)\" button_letter_spacing__hover_enabled=\"on\" button_letter_spacing__hover=\"4px\"][/et_pb_button][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_padding=\"||0px|||\" custom_css_main_element=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #DDDDDD;\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"bottom\"][et_pb_row custom_padding=\"90px||\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" text_font=\"||||||||\" text_text_align=\"center\" header_font=\"|300||on|||||\" header_text_align=\"center\" header_letter_spacing=\"4px\"]<h1>Informasi</h1>\n<p>Dapatkan informasi menarik tentang Islam yang tentunya sangat bermanfaat untuk Anda.</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_blog fullwidth=\"off\" posts_number=\"3\" include_categories=\"all\" use_manual_excerpt=\"off\" show_more=\"on\" show_author=\"off\" show_date=\"off\" show_categories=\"off\" show_pagination=\"off\" module_class=\"custom-blog-grid\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" body_font=\"||||||||\" body_text_align=\"left\"][/et_pb_blog][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section]', 'Beranda', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '8-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-07-08 12:04:12', '2019-07-08 12:04:12', '', 8, 'https://pondokroja.com/8-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
