\"padding-bottom: 0;\">\n<li>Lulusan SD/MI (tingkat SMP)</li>\n<li>Lulusan SMP/MTs (tingkat SMA)</li>\n<li>Mengisi Formulir Pendaftaran</li>\n<li>FC Raport (2 Lembar)</li>\n<li>FC Ijazah & SKHU  (2 Lembar)</li>\n<li>FC Akta Kelahiran (2 Lembar)</li>\n<li>FC Kartu Keluarga (2 Lembar)</li>\n<li>Foto 2 x 3 (4 Lembar)</li>\n</ol>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"1_2\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_css_main_element=\"position: relative;||background: #FFFFFF;||border-radius: 20px;||padding: 40px;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"][et_pb_blurb title=\"Waktu Pendaftaran\" use_icon=\"on\" font_icon=\"%%227%%\" icon_color=\"#ffffff\" icon_placement=\"left\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" header_font=\"|||on|||||\" header_letter_spacing=\"4px\" animation=\"off\" custom_css_blurb_image=\"background: #FF147B;||position: absolute;||width: 60px;||height: 60px;||text-align: center;||padding: 8px;||border-radius: 60px;||left: -65px;||border: 5px solid #FFFFFF;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"]<p><strong>Gelombang 1 :</strong><br />15 Agustus 2020 s/d 20 Desember 2020<br /> <strong>Gelombang 2 :</strong><br /> 26 Desember 2020 s/d 7 Februari 2021</p>\n<p><em>Pendaftaran ditutup sewaktu-waktu bila kuota terpenuhi</em></p>\n<p>Kuota SMP : 44 Orang<br /> Kuota SMA : 15 Orang</p>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=\"1_2,1_2\" make_equal=\"on\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_column type=\"1_2\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_css_main_element=\"position: relative;||background: #FFFFFF;||border-radius: 20px;||padding: 40px;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"][et_pb_blurb title=\"Biaya Pendidikan\" use_icon=\"on\" font_icon=\"%%281%%\" icon_color=\"#ffffff\" icon_placement=\"left\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" header_font=\"|||on|||||\" header_letter_spacing=\"4px\" animation=\"off\" custom_css_blurb_image=\"background: #F86E01;||position: absolute;||width: 60px;||height: 60px;||text-align: center;||padding: 9px;||border-radius: 60px;||left: -65px;||border: 5px solid #FFFFFF;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"]<ol style=\"padding-bottom: 0;\">\n    <li>Pendaftaran : <strong>Rp 150.000</strong> / Awal masuk</li>\n    <li>Seragam 4 stel <strong>Rp 700.000</strong> / Awal masuk</li>\n    <li>Syahriyah (makan, asrama & SPP) : <strong>Rp 500.000</strong> / Bulan</li>\n    <li>LKS : <strong>Rp 150.000</strong> / Semester</li>\n    <li>Kesantrian : <strong>Rp 200.000</strong> / Semester</li>\n    <li>\n        Wakaf Produktif :\n        <ul style=\"padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 40px; list-style-type: upper-latin;\">\n            <li>Rp 3.000.000</li>\n            <li>Rp 2.500.000</li>\n            <li>Rp 2.000.000</li>\n        </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li>Kitab / Buku, almari, kasur, bantal & perlengkapan MCK bisa bawa sendiri atau pesan di Toko Pondok</li>\n</ol>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"1_2\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_button button_url=\"https://psb.pondokroja.com\" url_new_window=\"on\" button_text=\"Daftar Sekarang\" button_alignment=\"center\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_button=\"on\" button_text_size=\"16px\" button_text_color=\"#ffffff\" button_bg_color=\"#FF147B\" button_border_width=\"5px\" button_border_color=\"#FF147B\" button_border_radius=\"5px\" button_letter_spacing=\"2px\" button_font=\"|700||on|||||\" button_use_icon=\"off\" custom_margin=\"||-22px\" custom_css_main_element=\"box-shadow: 0 14px 26px -12px rgba(233,30,99,.42), 0 4px 23px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.12), 0 8px 10px -5px rgba(233,30,99,.2);\" button_letter_spacing__hover_enabled=\"on\" button_letter_spacing__hover=\"4px\" locked=\"off\"][/et_pb_button][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_