||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"]<ol style=\"padding-bottom: 0;\">\n<li>Kelas 6 atau lulusan SD/MI sederajat</li>\n<li>FC Kartu Keluarga (2 Lembar)</li>\n<li>Mendaftar online pada psb.pondokroja.com</li>\n</ol>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"1_2\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_css_main_element=\"position: relative;||background: #FFFFFF;||border-radius: 20px;||padding: 40px;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"][et_pb_blurb title=\"Waktu Pendaftaran\" use_icon=\"on\" font_icon=\"%%227%%\" icon_color=\"#ffffff\" icon_placement=\"left\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" header_font=\"|||on|||||\" header_letter_spacing=\"4px\" animation=\"off\" custom_css_blurb_image=\"background: #FF147B;||position: absolute;||width: 60px;||height: 60px;||text-align: center;||padding: 8px;||border-radius: 60px;||left: -65px;||border: 5px solid #FFFFFF;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"]<p>10 Agustus 2022 s/d 17 November 2022</p>\n<p><em>Pendaftaran ditutup sewaktu-waktu bila kuota terpenuhi</em></p>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=\"1_2,1_2\" make_equal=\"on\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_column type=\"1_2\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_css_main_element=\"position: relative;||background: #FFFFFF;||border-radius: 20px;||padding: 40px;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"][et_pb_blurb title=\"Biaya Pendidikan\" use_icon=\"on\" font_icon=\"%%281%%\" icon_color=\"#ffffff\" icon_placement=\"left\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" header_font=\"|||on|||||\" header_letter_spacing=\"4px\" animation=\"off\" custom_css_blurb_image=\"background: #F86E01;||position: absolute;||width: 60px;||height: 60px;||text-align: center;||padding: 9px;||border-radius: 60px;||left: -65px;||border: 5px solid #FFFFFF;||box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);\"]<ol style=\"padding-bottom: 0;\">\n<li>Pendaftaran : <strong>Rp 300.000</strong> / Awal masuk</li>\n<li>Seragam 4 stel <strong>Rp 1.000.000</strong> / Awal masuk</li>\n<li>Syahriyah (makan, asrama &amp; SPP) : <strong>Rp 750.000</strong> / Bulan</li>\n<li>LKS : <strong>Rp 250.000</strong> / Semester</li>\n<li>Kesantrian : <strong>Rp 350.000</strong> / Semester</li>\n<li>Wakaf Produktif :<br /><br />\n<ul style=\"padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 40px; list-style-type: upper-latin;\">\n<li>Rp 3.000.000</li>\n<li>Rp 3.500.000</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Kitab (bisa membawa sendiri) <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">Rp 500.000</span></li>\n<li>Kasur <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">Rp 450.000</span></li>\n<li>Lemari <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">Rp 400.000</span></li>\n<li>Bantal <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">Rp 100.000</span></li>\n</ol>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"1_2\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_css_main_element=\"height: 1px;\"][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row custom_padding_tablet=\"0px||\" custom_padding_last_edited=\"on|phone\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_button button_url=\"https://psb.pondokroja.com\" url_new_window=\"on\" button_text=\"Daftar Sekarang\" button_alignment=\"center\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_button=\"on\" button_text_size=\"16px\" button_text_color=\"#ffffff\" button_bg_color=\"#FF147B\" button_border_width=\"5px\" button_border_color=\"#FF147B\" button_border_radius=\"5px\" button_letter_spacing=\"2px\" button_font=\"|700||on|||||\" button_use_icon=\"off\" custom_margin=\"||-22px\" custom_css_main_element=\"box-shadow: 0 14px 26px -12px rgba(233,30,99,.42), 0 4px 23px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.12), 0 8px 10px -5px rgba(233,30,99,.2);\" lock