(1302, 2, '2022-08-27 04:38:40', '2022-08-27 04:38:40', '[et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" fullwidth=\"on\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" background_color=\"#F86E01\" custom_padding=\"0px||0px\" bottom_divider_style=\"ramp2\" bottom_divider_color=\"#F7F9FB\" bottom_divider_flip=\"horizontal\"][et_pb_fullwidth_header title=\"Kegiatan\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" title_font=\"||||||||\" title_font_size=\"40px\" background_color=\"#F86E01\" custom_padding=\"32px||29px|||\"]<p>Berbagai aktifitas santri di pondok baik formal ataupun non formal dibuat jadwal secara rutin dan teratur dengan batasan-batasan waktu. Adapun jadwal kegiatan rutin tersebut adalah sebagai berikut :</p>[/et_pb_fullwidth_header][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" background_color=\"#F7F9FB\"][et_pb_row custom_padding=\"0px||0px|||\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" text_font=\"||||||||\" text_text_align=\"center\" text_text_color=\"#ffffff\" header_font=\"|||on|||||\" header_text_align=\"center\" header_letter_spacing=\"4px\" header_3_font=\"|300||on|||||\" header_3_letter_spacing=\"4px\"]<h3>JADWAL KEGIATAN</h3>\n<h1>TARBIYATUL MUHAFIDZOTIL QUR’AN</h1>\n<h3>PESANTREN ROOIHATUL JANNAH  HIDAYATULLAH SUKOHARJO</h3>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" background_color=\"#F7F9FB\" custom_padding=\"0px||65px|||\"][et_pb_row custom_margin=\"||40px\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" custom_css_main_element=\"box-shadow: 0 5px 20px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 13px 24px -11px rgba(0,0,0,0);||border-radius: 20px;||padding: 40px;||background: #FFFFFF;\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"3.25.4\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"3.25.4\" text_font=\"||||||||\" text_text_align=\"center\" text_text_color=\"#ffffff\" text_letter_spacing=\"2px\" header_font=\"|||on|||||\" header_text_align=\"center\" header_letter_spaci